WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.345 --> 01:39.385
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:42.065 --> 01:44.385
Alex's job handover is almost complete.

01:45.105 --> 01:46.745
The headquarters will have
a say regarding the appointment

01:46.825 --> 01:48.105
of the next marketing manager.

01:48.185 --> 01:51.585
We need to begin hiring now
to fill up the empty slots he left behind.

01:54.345 --> 01:55.785
Who did he bring with him?

01:55.865 --> 01:57.505
Annie. Ethan.

01:57.585 --> 01:59.025
They have talked to me.

02:01.505 --> 02:02.545
What about Shang Zhitao?

02:04.065 --> 02:05.585
She hasn't spoken to me.

02:07.105 --> 02:08.465
You care a lot about her.

02:09.065 --> 02:11.465
I remember when she just joined,

02:11.545 --> 02:14.105
you kept asking her to resign.

02:15.265 --> 02:17.425
What? Finally noticed her talents?

02:18.665 --> 02:19.665
Yes.

02:20.185 --> 02:21.705
She is talented.

02:21.785 --> 02:22.745
I want to keep her here.

02:24.465 --> 02:25.545
As per our company's SOP,

02:26.145 --> 02:28.785
HR is supposed to talk
to those who plan to leave

02:28.865 --> 02:31.785
to understand their dissatisfaction
before persuading them to stay.

02:35.465 --> 02:38.905
If only you knew then what you know now.

02:45.305 --> 02:49.625
LOVE IS MAKING EXCEPTIONS

02:51.185 --> 02:52.185
Is it very serious?

02:52.705 --> 02:55.705
The patient fainted from hypoglycemia
due to not eating on time

02:55.785 --> 02:56.785
and overworking.

02:56.865 --> 02:58.745
His body just collapsed.

02:59.385 --> 03:01.305
We will ask him to stay here for a while.

03:01.385 --> 03:03.985
Make sure he eats properly

03:04.065 --> 03:05.465
-and rests well.
-Okay. Okay.

03:06.465 --> 03:07.865
Sir.

03:09.385 --> 03:11.665
My brother works too hard.

03:11.745 --> 03:15.345
Can you exaggerate his condition a bit?

03:15.425 --> 03:18.625
I want him to rest here
for a few more days.

03:18.705 --> 03:20.345
He's staying here no matter what.

03:20.425 --> 03:21.905
As for how many days,
it depends on his recovery.

03:22.865 --> 03:23.945
That's all.

03:24.025 --> 03:25.465
-Okay.
-Thank you, Doctor.

03:25.545 --> 03:26.465
Thanks.

03:33.145 --> 03:34.065
Is Zhu all right?

03:34.145 --> 03:35.225
He's fine.

03:37.505 --> 03:38.505
Anyway,

03:39.425 --> 03:41.145
I told the doctor that I was his sister

03:41.745 --> 03:44.185
so that he could stay longer here
and rest.

03:44.265 --> 03:45.465
Don't tell him.

03:47.145 --> 03:48.065
Okay.

03:48.145 --> 03:50.665
You made the right decision.

03:51.545 --> 03:52.385
Let's check on him.

03:54.625 --> 03:55.825
-This ward?
-Yes.

03:57.425 --> 03:58.905
Why are you sitting up?

04:00.665 --> 04:01.785
Tao, how come you're here?

04:03.625 --> 04:05.225
What do you think?

04:06.385 --> 04:07.345
I'm fine.

04:07.425 --> 04:09.985
It's just that I didn't eat and fainted.

04:10.865 --> 04:12.425
How embarrassing.

04:14.065 --> 04:16.624
It is embarrassing. You're an adult
who fainted from starvation.

04:17.225 --> 04:19.944
Zhu. This might sound harsh.

04:20.025 --> 04:23.025
Work is important,
but your health is what lets you work.

04:25.425 --> 04:26.425
I know.

04:26.945 --> 04:28.265
I accept your opinion.

04:28.985 --> 04:32.065
I promise that I'll eat
on time from now on.

04:32.145 --> 04:32.985
This won't happen again.

04:33.065 --> 04:34.305
Swear now.

04:42.185 --> 04:45.305
Perhaps you guys should head back first?

04:45.385 --> 04:46.305
You have work tomorrow.

04:46.905 --> 04:48.025
Kicking us out already?

04:48.105 --> 04:50.145
The doctor said if you neglected
your health again,

04:50.225 --> 04:51.385
you would be sent here.

04:53.705 --> 04:55.225
Yes.

04:57.585 --> 04:58.465
We'll be going then.

05:01.745 --> 05:02.665
Leave him be.

05:04.185 --> 05:05.345
Rest well.

05:06.065 --> 05:07.305
Drive safe.

05:18.625 --> 05:19.785
I am your dad.

05:19.865 --> 05:21.065
I raised you.

05:21.145 --> 05:23.225
Is it wrong to ask you to repay me now?

05:37.745 --> 05:40.625
INPATIENT ONE

05:43.265 --> 05:44.265
Mom.

05:44.785 --> 05:48.025
Didn't I just transfer
5,000 yuan to you last month?

05:50.625 --> 05:51.985
All gone already?

05:55.145 --> 05:56.825
Dad bet on horses again?

05:59.505 --> 06:01.985
Mom, stop saying you're going to die.

06:03.105 --> 06:04.985
If he hits you, call the police.

06:05.065 --> 06:07.945
If that doesn't work, run away.
Call the police.

06:12.665 --> 06:14.585
Don't worry about the money.

06:15.905 --> 06:17.305
Let me finish my work first.

07:26.025 --> 07:27.825
Yuanzhu.

07:27.905 --> 07:29.745
Guess what I brought you.

07:30.585 --> 07:32.065
Claypot rice porridge.

07:32.625 --> 07:33.545
Eat while it's warm.

07:47.385 --> 07:48.585
Take a seat.

07:55.745 --> 07:57.705
As you know, Alex resigned.

07:57.785 --> 08:01.145
I arranged the meeting today
to have a conversation with you.

08:02.305 --> 08:03.665
What would you like to talk about?

08:04.345 --> 08:06.265
How's your work lately? Too much?

08:06.345 --> 08:07.305
Do you have to work overtime?

08:08.505 --> 08:11.385
Unless it's urgent,
I don't usually work overtime.

08:11.465 --> 08:12.625
I do have weekends to myself.

08:13.425 --> 08:15.425
What do you usually do during weekends?

08:17.225 --> 08:18.385
Weekends?

08:30.345 --> 08:31.185
Give me an example.

08:33.465 --> 08:34.664
For example…

08:37.625 --> 08:38.784
For example,

08:39.305 --> 08:40.345
I'll hang out with my friends.

08:40.425 --> 08:43.784
We go shopping, drink coffee,
and enjoy the sun.

08:45.585 --> 08:47.065
Are you seeing anyone now?

08:50.345 --> 08:51.185
No.

08:54.705 --> 08:55.785
Great.

08:55.865 --> 08:57.865
A junior of mine just came back.

08:57.945 --> 08:59.945
He's three years older than you.

09:00.025 --> 09:02.105
He's quite nice
and is from a decent family.

09:02.185 --> 09:04.625
Should I introduce him to you?

09:11.025 --> 09:14.185
Are you happy with the career growth
we have given you?

09:14.785 --> 09:15.985
Yes.

09:17.425 --> 09:20.345
Flora, if Alex has given you an offer,

09:21.305 --> 09:22.265
I hope you will turn him down.

09:24.945 --> 09:26.105
In a new company,

09:26.625 --> 09:29.145
your short-term salary increase
comes with a high risk.

09:30.225 --> 09:31.065
Staying with us

09:31.745 --> 09:33.825
allows you to be the top player
in the industry.

09:34.465 --> 09:35.385
Your bosses can always change.

09:36.065 --> 09:38.865
Only your capability
will make you stand out.

09:41.665 --> 09:43.105
As Luke has said,

09:43.185 --> 09:45.825
we have our own training program
and growth option.

09:46.545 --> 09:48.625
As long as you work hard,

09:48.705 --> 09:51.265
you can start from a normal staff member
and become the general manager.

09:51.945 --> 09:54.785
Additionally, our remuneration
is among the most competitive ones,

09:54.865 --> 09:55.785
and you will receive yearly increments.

09:56.505 --> 09:58.705
This year, we intend
to increase your salary range.

10:05.265 --> 10:06.105
Tracy also mentioned to me

10:07.225 --> 10:11.425
that your performance was highly valued
in the workplace evaluation.

10:13.065 --> 10:15.905
I personally have seen your sacrifices,
dedication, and growth.

10:16.625 --> 10:18.025
I agree with the evaluation.

10:19.545 --> 10:20.865
So I hope

10:20.945 --> 10:24.385
you can stay and work together with us.

10:28.345 --> 10:29.585
Thank you.

10:29.665 --> 10:30.665
Thank you, Luke.

10:41.905 --> 10:44.465
When I joined Lime,

10:44.985 --> 10:46.985
I knew I was quite plain and average.

10:47.065 --> 10:49.225
It was by sheer luck
that I managed to stay here.

10:49.745 --> 10:51.785
I am grateful for everything I have now.

10:52.545 --> 10:53.425
I…

10:53.985 --> 10:55.945
I love the work ambiance here.

10:59.145 --> 11:00.745
I love the people here.

11:02.065 --> 11:04.585
And I know I have yet
to learn many things.

11:05.145 --> 11:06.505
So,

11:07.625 --> 11:08.465
Tracy,

11:09.745 --> 11:10.585
Luke,

11:12.065 --> 11:13.905
I will stay at Lime.

11:30.945 --> 11:32.025
I'll take my leave then.

11:32.545 --> 11:35.705
You two can discuss
the range of the increments.

11:43.905 --> 11:45.985
Flora. Your honesty is much appreciated.

11:47.105 --> 11:50.345
I was about to use my last bargaining chip
to convince you to stay.

11:51.585 --> 11:52.905
What is it?

11:54.025 --> 11:55.505
When Luke's scandal broke out,

11:55.585 --> 11:56.985
you and Lumi came to me to attest for him.

11:57.065 --> 11:57.985
Do you still remember that?

11:58.945 --> 11:59.785
Yes.

12:00.305 --> 12:02.225
There was an investigation,

12:02.305 --> 12:04.545
but the result was not made public.

12:05.505 --> 12:07.505
Because Luke chose
not to pursue it further.

12:07.585 --> 12:09.185
It involved Alex.

12:10.465 --> 12:12.145
It's all in the past now.

12:12.705 --> 12:15.785
I just wanted to remind you
that even if you're leaving,

12:15.865 --> 12:18.985
make sure you know
who you're leaving with.

12:21.945 --> 12:23.025
Noted.

12:26.945 --> 12:28.025
How did the recruitment go?

12:28.105 --> 12:29.625
We vetted through the resumes.

12:29.705 --> 12:30.865
Once the first interview is done,

12:30.945 --> 12:32.265
I'll schedule
the second interview with you.

12:37.385 --> 12:40.345
Are you seeing anyone now? Great.

12:40.425 --> 12:42.025
A junior of mine just came back.

12:42.665 --> 12:44.825
Should I introduce him to you?

12:46.665 --> 12:47.785
Now I know why your division failed

12:47.865 --> 12:49.585
to notice someone
was poaching our manager.

12:50.985 --> 12:52.025
Why?

12:52.665 --> 12:57.025
You're too busy setting up dates
for your employees to work.

12:57.105 --> 12:58.505
It was just a friendly chit-chat.

12:58.585 --> 13:00.145
Why are you so serious?

13:00.225 --> 13:02.025
Relax.

13:02.105 --> 13:03.425
I am relaxed.

13:03.505 --> 13:05.385
But you guys might be too relaxed.

13:07.185 --> 13:09.185
Fine. I can't win in an argument
against you.

13:09.265 --> 13:10.105
You win.

13:39.505 --> 13:40.545
Flora.

13:43.865 --> 13:45.185
Do you have time for a stroll?

13:48.665 --> 13:49.505
Sure.

14:02.945 --> 14:04.425
I'm happy that you're staying.

14:06.505 --> 14:08.185
I mean what I said today.

14:10.185 --> 14:11.785
I'm sorry to have called you cheap

14:13.145 --> 14:14.305
and obedient.

14:15.985 --> 14:18.745
I was just describing
what my thinking process would be

14:19.505 --> 14:22.185
if I were a manager
trying to poach other staff members.

14:23.865 --> 14:24.865
I didn't mince my words.

14:30.265 --> 14:31.305
I…

14:32.105 --> 14:34.105
I did say a lot of things
out of spite too.

14:37.985 --> 14:41.505
But when I reflected upon myself,
I realized some of your advice was good,

14:42.145 --> 14:43.345
just a bit harsh.

14:46.745 --> 14:48.225
I accept your apology

14:49.505 --> 14:51.505
because I know you are a gentleman.

14:51.585 --> 14:54.065
You have never bad-mouthed Alex.

14:58.785 --> 15:02.065
I know I can be blunt, but I mean well.

15:03.185 --> 15:05.225
If whatever I say ever upsets you,

15:05.745 --> 15:06.825
you can tell me right away.

15:08.665 --> 15:10.185
Don't block me.

15:13.065 --> 15:14.345
Dealing with it is quite exhausting.

15:19.665 --> 15:21.025
Then can you…

15:23.945 --> 15:25.265
praise me more?

15:26.185 --> 15:27.345
Luan Nian.

15:27.945 --> 15:29.185
I need your encouragement.

15:29.945 --> 15:31.825
I love it when you speak to me nicely.

15:34.065 --> 15:34.945
Okay.

15:36.225 --> 15:37.785
More encouragement and compliments.

15:38.425 --> 15:39.465
I'll take note.

15:42.145 --> 15:43.425
Do you want to eat something?

15:44.345 --> 15:48.345
I want to eat meat
and drink a little bit. Just a little bit.

15:48.945 --> 15:50.825
No. You bite when you're drunk.

15:51.425 --> 15:53.545
No. I have never bitten anyone.

15:59.065 --> 16:02.465
So when are you going to unblock me?

16:03.105 --> 16:05.785
I'll unblock you when you buy me drinks.

16:25.105 --> 16:26.145
Here. Come in, Guo.

16:28.785 --> 16:30.025
What are you?

16:30.105 --> 16:31.585
How come you have the keys to my home?

16:31.665 --> 16:32.705
I am an agent.

16:32.785 --> 16:34.065
The owner of this flat wants to sell it.

16:34.145 --> 16:35.065
I brought a client to view it.

16:35.905 --> 16:36.745
You must be the tenant.

16:36.825 --> 16:37.865
Move out quickly.

16:37.945 --> 16:38.625
-Wait.
-Come in.

16:38.705 --> 16:39.625
You must have gotten something wrong.

16:39.705 --> 16:41.905
The owner of this property is Zhang Lei.

16:41.985 --> 16:44.065
And Ms. Zhou is Zhang Lei's ex-wife.

16:44.145 --> 16:45.345
She is also a co-owner of this property.

16:45.945 --> 16:48.185
She has the property ownership certificate
and the sales and purchase agreement.

16:48.265 --> 16:50.105
She has authorized us
to handle this property.

16:50.185 --> 16:51.025
Please move out quickly.

16:51.625 --> 16:53.225
Guo, let's go inside.

16:53.745 --> 16:54.905
The layout is good.

16:54.985 --> 16:56.105
It is.

16:56.865 --> 16:57.785
Lei,

16:57.865 --> 17:00.025
an agent said your ex-wife
would be selling the flat.

17:00.105 --> 17:01.665
He brought someone to view the property.

17:01.745 --> 17:02.905
-It's not bad, right?
-Yes.

17:03.585 --> 17:04.424
Check out that place.

17:05.265 --> 17:06.184
‎It looks good.

17:07.145 --> 17:08.545
Tao. I'm so sorry.

17:08.625 --> 17:11.305
My ex-wife lost a lot of money in her
investment and needs money urgently.

17:11.385 --> 17:12.865
She appointed an agent behind my back.

17:12.944 --> 17:14.905
Once I finish my work,
I'll buy a ticket and fly back.

17:14.985 --> 17:16.625
Do not fight them.

17:16.704 --> 17:17.985
Let me handle it when I'm there.

17:18.065 --> 17:19.345
Okay, Lei.

17:19.424 --> 17:20.704
Hurry up.

17:20.785 --> 17:21.785
Okay.

17:22.305 --> 17:23.825
My client is happy with this place.

17:23.905 --> 17:25.665
I need this property
to be vacant in two days.

17:25.745 --> 17:26.585
Please move out soon.

17:27.585 --> 17:29.945
Guo. Let's talk at the shop
near the entrance.

17:31.265 --> 17:32.105
Come.

17:32.185 --> 17:33.305
Move out now.

17:42.185 --> 17:43.785
What do we do?

17:43.865 --> 17:45.945
We can't find a place on short notice.

17:46.025 --> 17:47.345
Don't worry.

17:47.425 --> 17:49.185
Wait for Lei to come back,
and we'll figure this out.

17:49.705 --> 17:50.545
Yuanzhu.

17:51.225 --> 17:53.505
Discharged already?
Are you sure you're okay?

17:53.585 --> 17:55.785
Did Lei tell you about the eviction?

17:58.465 --> 18:00.665
Lei already talked to his ex-wife.
We're not moving.

18:02.025 --> 18:02.865
We're not?

18:04.185 --> 18:05.425
It's okay now.

18:06.665 --> 18:08.545
That's great.

18:08.625 --> 18:10.865
I knew it. The matter can be solved.

18:11.385 --> 18:13.905
The most important lesson for those
who come to Beijing, eviction.

18:13.985 --> 18:15.985
This is my third home.

18:16.065 --> 18:18.225
If we truly are evicted,
we'll find a place together.

18:18.305 --> 18:19.185
Right?

18:19.985 --> 18:20.825
Don't worry.

18:30.105 --> 18:32.145
GUAANZHUANG STATION

18:38.825 --> 18:40.225
Why is it so cold here?

18:42.385 --> 18:43.305
A power cut?

18:46.305 --> 18:47.305
What happened?

18:48.385 --> 18:49.505
Sun Yu.

18:53.505 --> 18:54.905
That jerk of an agent must have done this.

18:57.745 --> 18:59.145
-Let me talk to him.
-Don't.

18:59.225 --> 19:01.185
We don't have proof that they did it.

19:03.665 --> 19:05.705
They did this to make us move out.

19:06.305 --> 19:07.625
They are bullying us.

19:08.345 --> 19:10.025
Tenants have rights too.

19:10.105 --> 19:11.025
They think they are above the law?

19:11.105 --> 19:12.505
Come. Let's confront them.

19:13.505 --> 19:14.785
Yuanzhu.

19:14.865 --> 19:16.625
Someone trashed our home.

19:16.705 --> 19:17.825
Wait for us at the entrance.

19:19.345 --> 19:21.265
Let's head to the management office
and get the security footage.

19:22.225 --> 19:23.065
Okay.

19:23.745 --> 19:24.785
Lei.

19:24.865 --> 19:26.105
-Lei.
-You're finally here.

19:26.185 --> 19:27.105
Where are you going?

19:27.185 --> 19:30.225
Someone broke our window
and cut off our power supply.

19:30.305 --> 19:31.745
I'm sure the real estate agency
by the entrance did it.

19:31.825 --> 19:33.225
We're planning to get
the security footage.

19:33.305 --> 19:34.785
They broke the window?

19:35.505 --> 19:36.625
Are you two okay?

19:37.225 --> 19:38.185
-I'm fine.
-I'm fine.

19:38.265 --> 19:39.625
Those hooligans.

19:40.145 --> 19:41.185
Let's check the security footage.

19:41.265 --> 19:43.265
If they did do it,
we'll report to the police.

19:45.225 --> 19:46.545
-The one over there?
-Yes.

19:46.625 --> 19:47.585
That one.

19:51.345 --> 19:52.265
Yuanzhu.

19:52.345 --> 19:53.585
You're right on time. Come.

19:54.545 --> 19:55.385
What?

19:55.465 --> 19:57.505
Don't stop us.
We checked the security footage.

19:57.585 --> 19:59.185
This agency broke our window.

19:59.265 --> 20:00.385
I demand compensation from them.

20:01.865 --> 20:03.745
Girls, you'll wait outside.

20:05.585 --> 20:06.585
Yuanzhu is right.

20:07.185 --> 20:09.465
Even though we notified the police,
we must make sure you are safe as well.

20:09.545 --> 20:10.585
Take this.

20:10.665 --> 20:11.625
-Okay.
-We'll go in first.

20:11.705 --> 20:13.425
-Wait for us here.
-Do not fight.

20:13.505 --> 20:15.545
-Be civilized.
-Let's go.

20:15.625 --> 20:16.865
Be civilized.

20:21.065 --> 20:22.625
-Where's your manager?
-He's not here.

20:22.705 --> 20:24.345
-Where's your manager?
-Like I said, he's not here.

20:24.425 --> 20:25.265
-Who broke my window?
-Just leave.

20:25.905 --> 20:27.225
Broke what window?
Are you looking for a fight?

20:27.305 --> 20:29.025
-How dare you?
-Dare what?

20:29.105 --> 20:30.185
-What are you doing?
-You broke my window.

20:30.265 --> 20:31.305
-No, I did not.
-Who broke my window?

20:31.385 --> 20:33.265
-Are they fighting now?
-This soon?

20:33.345 --> 20:34.345
Put those girls in a gunny sack.

20:34.425 --> 20:35.945
-What did you just say?
-Did you touch me?

20:36.025 --> 20:37.425
Did you push me?

20:37.505 --> 20:39.225
How dare you threaten us?

20:39.305 --> 20:40.545
-I'll call the police.
-You…

20:47.745 --> 20:49.345
You… Stop!

20:49.425 --> 20:50.265
You…

20:50.785 --> 20:52.105
Bugger off!

20:53.665 --> 20:54.985
-Stop!
-Run!

20:55.985 --> 20:57.705
-Stop!
-Tao. Are you okay?

20:57.785 --> 21:00.225
-I'm done with you!
-Throwing punches now?

21:06.425 --> 21:07.665
Die!

21:09.545 --> 21:11.425
-Stop! Stop it.
-Stop.

21:11.505 --> 21:13.505
Stop. Do you hear me?

21:13.585 --> 21:14.665
Stop now.

21:15.305 --> 21:16.785
-They started it.
-Are you okay?

21:17.745 --> 21:19.145
-They hit us.
-They did it first.

21:19.225 --> 21:20.105
-He hit me.
-Are you all right?

21:20.185 --> 21:22.225
-Officer. He hit me.
-They started it.

21:22.305 --> 21:23.625
-Bring them back.
-Are you okay?

21:23.705 --> 21:24.625
Come with me for the deposition.

21:30.585 --> 21:33.345
FEBRUARY 14TH, UNITE WITH LOVE

21:58.865 --> 21:59.705
Give me your hand.

22:07.625 --> 22:08.905
Bear with me.

22:22.385 --> 22:23.945
I'll do it myself.

22:31.945 --> 22:32.985
Is your face okay?

22:34.345 --> 22:35.385
I'm fine.

22:37.225 --> 22:39.585
Sun Yu. Does it hurt?

22:40.425 --> 22:41.865
It's just a scratch. Don't worry.

22:43.585 --> 22:44.425
Put it on.

22:46.065 --> 22:47.105
Thanks.

22:52.225 --> 22:53.065
Sun Yuanzhu.

22:54.385 --> 22:55.345
Please

22:56.145 --> 22:58.665
don't get into a fight again.

22:59.305 --> 23:00.865
You're a smart guy.

23:00.945 --> 23:02.345
Don't fight.

23:04.785 --> 23:08.265
We were just talking,
but then they threatened

23:08.865 --> 23:11.145
to put you two in a gunny sack
if we continued.

23:11.785 --> 23:12.985
So we had to be physical.

23:22.025 --> 23:22.945
It's not worth it.

23:24.185 --> 23:25.465
It is.

23:25.545 --> 23:27.785
It is by fate that the four of us
found each other.

23:29.065 --> 23:30.985
I wasn't there back then,
so I couldn't do much.

23:32.145 --> 23:33.545
Now that they threatened to harm you,

23:34.745 --> 23:36.225
we will step in to protect you.

23:45.305 --> 23:47.785
Guys. It's all my fault.

23:47.865 --> 23:49.265
I will shoulder the responsibilities.

23:50.985 --> 23:52.825
I'll find a place for all of you
as soon as possible.

24:00.985 --> 24:01.985
Are we…

24:05.865 --> 24:07.345
parting ways now?

24:10.265 --> 24:11.225
Unless

24:12.465 --> 24:13.745
I buy this place.

24:16.025 --> 24:17.825
But I don't have money now.

24:32.665 --> 24:34.585
Everything comes to an end eventually.

24:35.385 --> 24:36.425
People come and go.

24:38.785 --> 24:40.345
That's life.

24:56.065 --> 24:57.425
I'll buy you bubble tea next time.

24:58.105 --> 24:58.985
Thanks.

25:00.585 --> 25:01.745
Tao.

25:04.145 --> 25:06.385
-What happened to your face?
-Nothing.

25:07.945 --> 25:09.385
Someone hit you?

25:10.185 --> 25:12.385
-Are you hurt?
-I'm fine.

25:12.465 --> 25:13.865
Come.

25:17.225 --> 25:18.625
Tell me. Who hit you?

25:20.665 --> 25:22.905
The real estate agency in my neighborhood.

25:24.185 --> 25:26.505
I see. Send me the address right now.

25:27.105 --> 25:28.185
-I'm fine.
-Look at you now.

25:28.265 --> 25:29.505
How is that fine?

25:30.185 --> 25:31.185
I don't care.

25:31.265 --> 25:32.345
What are you doing?

25:35.705 --> 25:37.345
Hello? Where are you?

25:38.225 --> 25:40.305
Stop eating. Someone hit my best friend.

25:41.345 --> 25:43.265
I'll send you the address later.
You'll come with me.

25:46.025 --> 25:47.745
They bullied my friend.

25:47.825 --> 25:48.985
I'm going to turn their place upside down.

25:49.065 --> 25:50.785
He won't even know what hit him.

25:53.105 --> 25:55.625
Lumi. I'm fine. We called the police.

25:55.705 --> 25:57.545
Their place has been closed down.
It's all in the past now.

25:58.225 --> 26:01.585
You have no idea how scummy
a real estate agency can be.

26:01.665 --> 26:04.305
They intimidate you every day.
They jam your lock.

26:04.385 --> 26:07.385
Listen. When it comes to those jerks,
you deal with them swiftly.

26:07.465 --> 26:11.505
The officer told us to come to them
if anything happened.

26:11.585 --> 26:13.785
Police officers can do it their way.

26:13.865 --> 26:15.985
I can do it my way.

26:41.065 --> 26:41.985
Morning, Luke.

26:48.425 --> 26:49.665
Someone hit you.

26:51.185 --> 26:52.305
I fell.

26:54.705 --> 26:57.505
Come to my office during your lunch break
to report on your work.

27:14.065 --> 27:15.345
What happened?

27:15.425 --> 27:16.465
You fell?

27:24.505 --> 27:25.505
SHANG ZHITAO

27:25.585 --> 27:26.425
Yes.

27:28.665 --> 27:29.745
Fall again.

27:30.265 --> 27:32.025
Let me see how you hit the corner
of your mouth.

27:32.105 --> 27:33.665
I'm impressed.

27:34.825 --> 27:36.385
You landed on your face.

27:48.345 --> 27:51.345
Lumi. What happened
to Shang Zhitao's face?

27:56.745 --> 27:58.145
Hit by the scummy real estate agency.

27:58.225 --> 27:59.065
LUMI

27:59.145 --> 28:00.425
I just found the agency.

28:13.865 --> 28:14.985
CHEN KUANNIAN

28:18.785 --> 28:19.785
Hello?

28:20.505 --> 28:22.505
You reported unethical businesses before,
didn't you?

28:23.585 --> 28:26.425
An illegal agency
contravened laws by committing

28:26.505 --> 28:28.225
verbal assault and physical violence.

28:29.185 --> 28:30.865
I need your help.

28:30.945 --> 28:32.025
We'll check it out together.

28:33.105 --> 28:34.145
Put my name as the plaintiff.

28:47.905 --> 28:49.345
That agency over there.

28:49.425 --> 28:50.425
That one?

28:50.945 --> 28:52.665
It breached the contract
and attacked others.

28:53.505 --> 28:54.705
CHENGJU REAL ESTATE

28:54.785 --> 28:56.305
-I'll ask around.
-Yes, please do.

28:56.385 --> 28:57.305
You can count on me.

29:00.425 --> 29:01.705
We're identifying the person in charge.

29:01.785 --> 29:02.625
Let's wait for a bit.

29:04.665 --> 29:06.305
You reported them in person.

29:06.385 --> 29:08.305
Just who exactly are they?

29:09.065 --> 29:09.905
Do you have any proof?

29:12.065 --> 29:13.625
Check their fire safety regulations.

29:13.705 --> 29:15.385
Then check if they operate
beyond their license.

29:15.905 --> 29:16.945
And then, check their taxes.

29:18.065 --> 29:19.425
Close them down.

29:19.505 --> 29:20.785
Investigate them one by one.

29:21.305 --> 29:22.385
I have time.

29:23.585 --> 29:24.945
You're mad.

29:26.425 --> 29:28.065
Don't show your face.

29:28.145 --> 29:29.465
What if they target you?

29:59.905 --> 30:00.945
This is the place.

30:01.465 --> 30:03.505
I see this agency has a lot of enemies.

30:04.665 --> 30:06.505
Another group of mobs to trash the place.

30:14.945 --> 30:15.785
Hello?

30:15.865 --> 30:16.905
Lumi.

30:16.985 --> 30:19.785
Leave with your underlings now.

30:20.465 --> 30:22.425
I don't want to bail you out
at the police station tomorrow.

30:23.305 --> 30:25.665
Boss. My men are here.

30:25.745 --> 30:27.625
We're not turning back.

30:27.705 --> 30:29.185
They hit my best friend.

30:29.265 --> 30:31.385
I'm avenging Shang Zhitao.

30:32.145 --> 30:33.025
Just leave.

30:33.105 --> 30:34.985
People like them need to be
dealt with lawfully.

30:35.705 --> 30:38.265
Boss. You're intervening personally?

30:44.105 --> 30:45.625
Guys, let's go back first.

30:46.345 --> 30:48.705
Someone will punish them for me.

30:48.785 --> 30:49.945
Let's go.

30:56.905 --> 30:58.545
You know them?

31:00.505 --> 31:01.985
-Mister.
-Yes?

31:03.265 --> 31:04.905
I have made several calls.

31:06.585 --> 31:07.705
And I did ask around.

31:07.785 --> 31:09.625
This agency has a criminal record.

31:09.705 --> 31:11.385
Anyway, you have lodged a report.

31:11.465 --> 31:13.625
It will be handled. Don't worry.

31:13.705 --> 31:15.385
Thank you for the hard work.

31:15.465 --> 31:17.425
All right. See you.

31:17.505 --> 31:18.625
Thank you so much.

31:18.705 --> 31:19.705
Don't mention it. Just doing my job.

31:22.745 --> 31:23.665
Boss.

31:23.745 --> 31:26.105
Several men in the agency
are straight-up cowards.

31:26.185 --> 31:29.185
They ganged up on Shang Zhitao
and the rest.

31:29.265 --> 31:31.545
Don't show mercy when your men hit them.

31:38.585 --> 31:39.825
Listen.

31:39.905 --> 31:41.505
She had it coming.

31:41.585 --> 31:43.265
We were fighting, and she rushed in.

31:43.345 --> 31:44.705
She was asking for it.

31:44.785 --> 31:46.625
Also, look at the scratches
on Zeng's hand.

31:46.705 --> 31:47.545
-See?
-Look.

31:47.625 --> 31:50.585
The girl's face was ruined.

31:50.665 --> 31:54.385
Listen. If you don't hit them,
they won't learn their lesson.

31:54.465 --> 31:56.185
But not this harsh.

31:56.265 --> 31:57.385
Those are kids.

31:57.465 --> 31:59.145
Buddy, you must be new here.

31:59.225 --> 32:00.385
A new owner in this neighborhood?

32:01.665 --> 32:04.185
Have a cigarette. Come.

32:05.625 --> 32:06.545
What happened to your hand?

32:06.625 --> 32:08.945
Someone created a scene
at my agency several days ago.

32:09.025 --> 32:10.785
Two girls scratched me.

32:11.305 --> 32:12.265
It's fine.

32:12.785 --> 32:15.905
But then a jerk reported our business.

32:15.985 --> 32:16.905
Right?

32:21.665 --> 32:22.905
It was me.

32:26.825 --> 32:27.945
I…

32:44.385 --> 32:45.665
Stop.

32:46.185 --> 32:47.065
What the heck?

32:47.145 --> 32:48.145
-What are you doing?
-What the heck?

32:50.385 --> 32:51.865
Why did you get into a fight?

32:52.705 --> 32:53.865
They started it first.

32:54.385 --> 32:55.225
-They said they would kill me
-Assault is a crime.

32:55.305 --> 32:56.425
if I didn't withdraw the report.

32:57.705 --> 32:59.505
Trying to be a thug, aren't you?

33:00.065 --> 33:01.305
I'll call the police now.

33:01.385 --> 33:02.385
No.

33:02.465 --> 33:05.785
-He hit us. Look around you.
-He hit us.

33:05.865 --> 33:06.905
This is serious.

33:06.985 --> 33:08.705
They hit you hard.

33:08.785 --> 33:10.585
I'm the one getting hit.

33:17.225 --> 33:18.825
They are leaving now?

33:18.905 --> 33:20.465
This is not over yet.

33:21.225 --> 33:22.985
-Get examined. We'll take your statement.
-I am just…

33:23.705 --> 33:25.265
-I'll head to the hospital with you.
-Enough.

33:25.345 --> 33:27.025
-It's standard procedure.
-I'm fine.

33:27.105 --> 33:28.305
They just left?

33:28.385 --> 33:29.465
It's just a bruise.

33:30.425 --> 33:31.465
Luan Nian.

33:32.185 --> 33:34.145
We've known each other for years.

33:34.225 --> 33:38.025
I didn't know you could be
such a protective boyfriend.

33:39.025 --> 33:40.745
I couldn't believe it myself either.

33:40.825 --> 33:42.825
I must meet her now.

33:42.905 --> 33:44.385
We'll invite Song and Tan Mian.

33:45.665 --> 33:49.265
If you tell anyone about this,
I'll tell your wife about all your exes.

33:52.385 --> 33:54.265
Why are you mad?

33:54.345 --> 33:55.985
Do you have to go this far?

34:05.905 --> 34:06.865
Shang Zhitao.

34:06.945 --> 34:08.344
Come down now. I'm by the entrance.

34:18.744 --> 34:20.145
Do you not have my number?

34:22.145 --> 34:23.425
I do.

34:23.505 --> 34:24.625
Why didn't you tell me
you got into a fight?

34:25.304 --> 34:26.784
Why didn't you tell me you got hit?

34:26.865 --> 34:29.185
Is my phone just for show,
or is your brain just for show?

34:30.784 --> 34:31.705
You're stupid.

34:31.784 --> 34:33.344
And your flatmates are also stupid.

34:34.105 --> 34:35.065
Fight the scummy agency?

34:36.425 --> 34:37.905
Do you think you're a heroine?

34:37.985 --> 34:39.385
That you can defend justice?

34:40.985 --> 34:42.425
Did I say you could speak?

34:47.465 --> 34:48.585
So you don't speak
when I told you not to speak.

34:48.665 --> 34:50.665
Are you this obedient? Speak.

34:55.625 --> 34:56.465
Speak now.

34:59.785 --> 35:02.025
I just thought your time was precious.

35:02.105 --> 35:03.305
And you were always busy.

35:03.385 --> 35:05.425
I didn't want to trouble you
for such a trivial matter.

35:05.505 --> 35:07.025
I can handle it.

35:09.585 --> 35:12.785
So getting evicted and getting hit
is a small matter, Shang Zhitao?

35:18.265 --> 35:19.465
What are we?

35:20.065 --> 35:21.585
At work, we're colleagues.

35:21.665 --> 35:23.465
Outside of work, we're nothing.
Is that it?

35:25.105 --> 35:28.185
But it's not exactly
something to brag about.

35:28.865 --> 35:30.305
It's quite embarrassing.

35:31.345 --> 35:32.585
Embarrassing?

35:34.105 --> 35:36.105
My girlfriend got hit,
and I was the last one to find out.

35:36.865 --> 35:38.225
That sure isn't embarrassing at all.

35:47.145 --> 35:48.025
Shang Zhitao.

35:48.545 --> 35:50.425
Did you ever view me as your boyfriend?

35:57.385 --> 35:59.105
Don't be mad.

35:59.185 --> 36:00.705
You can scold me.

36:00.785 --> 36:01.865
Just drive properly.

36:03.105 --> 36:04.425
Look at your face. It's ruined.

36:06.305 --> 36:08.265
I've asked the doctor.

36:08.345 --> 36:10.345
He said it wouldn't leave a scar.

36:10.945 --> 36:12.505
Now you're worried about scarring.

36:12.585 --> 36:13.665
You deserve a scar.

36:14.785 --> 36:16.545
Stupid.

36:20.465 --> 36:21.465
Does it hurt?

36:23.465 --> 36:24.745
Show me.

36:28.025 --> 36:30.105
It doesn't hurt when you show you care.

36:31.385 --> 36:32.225
Go away.

36:33.425 --> 36:34.625
Who cares about you?

36:57.825 --> 36:58.985
Don't be mad.

37:01.145 --> 37:02.025
What was that?

37:06.065 --> 37:06.945
You…

37:08.145 --> 37:09.985
How did you get hurt?

37:10.665 --> 37:11.625
What happened?

37:12.305 --> 37:13.545
It's none of your business.

37:14.865 --> 37:17.465
You didn't tell me everything,
so I won't tell you either.

37:20.225 --> 37:21.465
Did you…

37:24.225 --> 37:25.545
confront that agency?

37:27.385 --> 37:28.425
They pissed me off.

37:33.105 --> 37:35.185
Does it hurt? Let me see.

37:35.265 --> 37:36.225
Where else did you get hurt?

37:36.305 --> 37:37.345
-It hurts.
-Show me.

37:38.025 --> 37:39.385
My mouth. My face. My leg.

37:39.465 --> 37:40.545
Everywhere hurts.

37:46.665 --> 37:47.505
Shang Zhitao.

37:48.705 --> 37:49.905
What is my number?

37:51.665 --> 37:52.625
I…

37:53.345 --> 37:54.385
I…

37:54.985 --> 37:55.945
Memorize it now.

38:06.505 --> 38:08.625
Don't be mad.

38:08.705 --> 38:11.625
I'll do my best
to memorize your number. Okay?

38:19.425 --> 38:20.305
You don't know my number?

38:22.065 --> 38:23.265
Memorize it now.

38:30.305 --> 38:31.145
One.

38:35.585 --> 38:36.785
Eight.

38:52.545 --> 38:53.865
Seven. Zero.

38:53.945 --> 38:54.985
Eight. Eight. Eight.

39:03.105 --> 39:04.945
Call me first if anything happens.

39:24.825 --> 39:25.785
Do you like it?

39:28.625 --> 39:29.745
I do.

39:55.265 --> 39:56.345
Let me see.

40:00.865 --> 40:02.425
It's so red.

40:03.025 --> 40:04.905
I'm fine. No broken bones.

40:15.305 --> 40:16.385
Does it hurt?

40:36.265 --> 40:37.625
Where are you going to stay now?

40:43.545 --> 40:46.065
I plan to stay here for a few days.

40:46.785 --> 40:47.705
Can I?

40:54.225 --> 40:55.305
How many days?

41:03.905 --> 41:04.785
Five days.

41:10.585 --> 41:11.425
Sure.

41:13.225 --> 41:16.665
Then can I borrow your car tomorrow?

41:20.985 --> 41:22.145
What for?

41:23.705 --> 41:28.025
I need a car to carry my things.

41:30.225 --> 41:31.425
Knowing your driving skills,

41:32.185 --> 41:33.025
I won't let you drive my car.

41:36.385 --> 41:37.505
I'll drive you there.

41:39.105 --> 41:40.385
Tomorrow after work?

41:40.905 --> 41:41.745
Okay.

41:44.105 --> 41:44.985
Oh.

41:45.985 --> 41:48.385
Tomorrow, I have a new flatmate.

41:52.185 --> 41:53.145
A new flatmate?

42:13.865 --> 42:14.865
Closed down?

42:15.545 --> 42:17.105
How come?

42:17.185 --> 42:18.945
I haven't even done anything.

42:22.665 --> 42:24.185
Someone made a report
about their fire safety regulations?

42:25.785 --> 42:27.345
They got hit as well?

42:28.505 --> 42:30.225
Locked up in the police station?

42:31.345 --> 42:32.385
I see.

42:36.585 --> 42:38.105
Our boss just taught those pricks

42:38.705 --> 42:40.945
who hit you a lesson.

42:41.945 --> 42:42.865
Who…

42:42.945 --> 42:44.105
Who?

42:45.425 --> 42:47.545
Luan Nian. Our boss.

42:47.625 --> 42:49.345
He's amazing.

42:49.425 --> 42:50.585
As our boss,

42:50.665 --> 42:53.905
he goes out of his way
to take care of our well-being.

42:55.545 --> 42:56.705
What did I tell you, Shang Zhitao?

42:57.465 --> 42:59.025
Luan Nian treats you differently.

43:00.185 --> 43:01.905
How did you know it was him?

43:02.665 --> 43:05.385
I was there. Then he called me
to ask me to go back.

43:06.425 --> 43:07.785
Tao.

43:07.865 --> 43:10.065
You must thank him this time.

43:11.985 --> 43:14.705
I know. I will thank him properly.

43:14.785 --> 43:18.145
And thank you too, Lumi,
for standing up for me.

43:18.225 --> 43:22.265
But please don't tell anyone about this.
It'll look bad.

43:23.985 --> 43:25.425
What's there to be afraid of? Why?

43:29.345 --> 43:32.185
I need to rush the proposal
regarding the two interns.

43:32.265 --> 43:33.905
Otherwise, I won't be able to go home.

43:33.985 --> 43:35.265
Go then.

43:35.345 --> 43:38.105
Mentoring an intern
is quite challenging at the beginning.

43:38.905 --> 43:40.945
It reminds me of the time
when you mentored me.

43:41.025 --> 43:42.305
It must have been tough on you.

43:42.385 --> 43:44.385
Don't humble yourself.

43:44.465 --> 43:45.905
I taught everyone the same thing.

43:45.985 --> 43:48.465
It's up to them
how they use the knowledge.

43:48.545 --> 43:50.105
And you did so well.

43:50.185 --> 43:51.025
All the best.

43:51.105 --> 43:54.705
Work hard, work more, so that I can chill.

43:55.705 --> 43:57.705
Yes. I work hard. You chill.

44:06.705 --> 44:07.465
LUAN NIAN

44:07.545 --> 44:08.505
See you at the parking lot.

44:17.185 --> 44:20.465
I need to head to a place
to pick up my new flatmate.

44:20.545 --> 44:22.545
PETISM

44:45.185 --> 44:46.025
Luan Nian.

45:20.705 --> 45:22.225
MISSING OWNER

45:22.305 --> 45:23.625
It's still here.

45:24.385 --> 45:26.665
-We're here to check on this dog.
-Sure.

45:26.745 --> 45:27.625
Puppy.

45:28.905 --> 45:29.985
-Hey.
-Puppy.

45:32.785 --> 45:34.025
Give him some water.

45:34.105 --> 45:36.145
-He's so obedient.
-Right?

45:36.225 --> 45:40.185
We put up the notice three months ago,
but no one came to claim him.

45:40.905 --> 45:42.785
We can't keep him in a pet store forever.

45:44.465 --> 45:46.905
Shang Zhitao, why are you so lucky?

45:46.985 --> 45:48.745
You ran into a Samoyed.

45:48.825 --> 45:50.385
It costs several thousand yuan for one.

45:52.705 --> 45:56.465
Do you think I can raise it?

45:57.625 --> 45:58.585
Sure.

45:59.145 --> 46:00.665
I love dogs too.

46:00.745 --> 46:02.265
I love them.

46:02.345 --> 46:03.905
If you want to raise him,
let's do it together.

46:04.425 --> 46:06.065
If Lei and Yuanzhu
are not allergic to fur,

46:06.145 --> 46:07.665
we can bring him home to live with us.

46:10.505 --> 46:11.865
What is your name?

46:11.945 --> 46:13.705
Let's give you a name.

46:13.785 --> 46:15.585
You will be…

46:17.385 --> 46:19.625
Luke. Luke.

46:19.705 --> 46:21.785
What? What's his name?

46:21.865 --> 46:22.985
Luke.

