46:29.465 --> 46:31.425
If you can't do it, just resign.

46:31.505 --> 46:34.105
Bad boy. Luke.

46:34.185 --> 46:35.705
-Sure. I like that name.
-Luke.

46:35.785 --> 46:36.745
You can destress.

46:39.905 --> 46:41.585
Luke.

46:44.025 --> 46:45.665
Does this mean you miss him a lot?

46:47.225 --> 46:48.465
No.

46:48.545 --> 46:50.265
Luke. Luke.

46:50.345 --> 46:51.185
Luke.

46:51.265 --> 46:53.025
I think he likes the name.

46:53.105 --> 46:54.585
Luke, you have a home now.

46:55.745 --> 46:56.825
Let's go home.

46:56.905 --> 46:58.385
Let's go home.
